    "description": "# BA-9: Players Related List\n\n_Players currently assigned to this BA._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Players currently assigned to this BA\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Not confirmed in the transcript\n\n* Sourced from the prototype only.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: BA-9 (Brand Ambassador Record User Stories doc).\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc BA-9 — Brand Ambassador Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.g64hrhse8pog)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-202 — Brand Ambassador: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693577680227/f/), [BUILD-173 — Player: Core Details fields](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217684264652851/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Brand Ambassador record documentation review.\n\n",
